<li><strong>Macro-motion (phrase sweep):</strong> a synth voice (such as bass on <code>"sawtooth"</code>) whose lowpass filter cutoff slowly evolves across the 4-bar phrase using <code>lpf</code> modulated by an LFO with <code>slow(4)</code>.</li>
