<ol>
<li><strong>Rhythm:</strong> a drum groove on a vintage drum bank (such as <code>bank("RolandTR808")</code>), featuring kick, backbeat snare, and subdivided hi-hats.</li>
<li><strong>Bass:</strong> a low bassline playing root notes at or above C3 on <code>"sawtooth"</code>, filtered with <code>lpf</code> to sit cleanly below the chords.</li>
<li><strong>Extended chords:</strong> a 4-bar progression of extended seventh chords voiced with <code>chord(...).voicing()</code> on a pad synth (such as <code>"supersaw"</code> with <code>detune</code>, or <code>"triangle"</code>), balanced with <code>gain</code> so the harmony enriches the groove without overpowering it.</li>
</ol>
